{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "ses_077436b26ffemd7pHz8BfiTKVY", "team_id": "contest2026_070_arc", "github_login": "arclau", "tool": "opencode", "ts": "2026-07-22T07:44:45.902Z", "role": "assistant", "seq": 93, "text": "备份完成！\n\n## 备份目录结构\n\n```\n/data/vela-backup/\n├── rk3568-firefly-8fhd-driver/    (140K)\n│   ├── rk3568_firefly_8fhd.c      # LCD 面板驱动\n│   ├── rk3568_firefly_8fhd.h      # LCD 面板头文件\n│   ├── rk3568_firefly_8fhd_mipi_config.c  # MIPI DSI 配置\n│   ├── panels.c                   # 面板注册\n│   ├── panels.h                   # 面板注册头文件\n│   ├── defconfig                  # 完整配置文件\n│   ├── rk3568-firefly-roc-pc-se-8fhd.dts  # Linux DTS 参考\n│   ├── build-config/              # 构建配置\n│   │   ├── lcd_Kconfig\n│   │   ├── disp2_Make.defs\n│   │   ├── disp2_CMakeLists.txt\n│   │   ├── soc_Makefile\n│   │   └── soc_Kconfig\n│   ├── CONFIG_GUIDE.md            # 配置指南\n│   └── README.md\n│\n└── gt911-touch-driver/            (64K)\n    ├── gt911_iic_touch.c          # GT911 触摸驱动\n    ├── gt911_iic_touch.h          # GT911 头文件\n    ├── board_drivers_Kconfig      # 板级 Kconfig\n    ├── board_drivers_Make.defs    # 板级 Make.defs\n    ├── fixtouch.md                # 调试文档\n    └── CONFIG_GUIDE.md            # 配置指南\n```\n\n## 关键配置项\n\n屏幕驱动恢复后需要在 defconfig 中启用:\n```\nCONFIG_LCD_SUPPORT_RK3568_FIREFLY_8FHD=y\nCONFIG_RK3568_FIREFLY_8FHD_MIPI=y\nCONFIG_GT911_IIC_TOUCH=y\n```\n\n每个目录下都有 `CONFIG_GUIDE.md`，详细说明了如何修改配置文件使驱动生效。现在可以删除 SDK 重新搞了。"}
